        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine)\n\nWhen a last guard is destroyed, they re-form after 2d4 days within the location they're bound to, fully healed. A last guard can be permanently destroyed and move on to the afterlife only if they successfully defend the location they're bound to from large-scale attack, or fulfill a call to war."
