              "value": "Frightful Battle Cry"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, divine, emotion, fear, mental, sonic)\n\nThe last guards unleash a soul-shaking bellow in unison. All creatures in a 60-foot cone take 7d6 sonic damage (DC 42 basic Will save). Any creature that fails its save is also frightened 3 (or frightened 4 on a critical failure). If the troop occupies 2 or fewer segments, this area decreases to a 30-foot cone."
