              "value": "Ghostly Blades"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe last guards engage in a coordinated attack with their spectral curved blades against each enemy within 5 feet (DC 40 basic Reflex save). The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n- **1A:** 1d8+2 slashing and 1d8 void damage\n- **2A:** 2d8+14 slashing and 2d8 void damage\n- **3A:** 3d8+14 slashing and 3d8 void damage"
